{"id":"u-4f3d29b6-780f-4d60-b268-b2299c6a5112","src":"community","title":"Vertical Jump Program","author":"Adam Elmetwally","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/h8IQEA-vertical-jump-program","desc":"The purpose of this program is to transform your athleticism and increase your vertical jump height through a science-backed combination of high-intensity plyometrics and advanced contrast strength training. Designed to help athletes break through plateaus, the routine focuses on training specificity, ensuring every movement mimics the explosive mechanics of a maximal jump,. By utilizing Post-Activation Potentiation (PAP) to recruit more motor units and targeting the stretch-shortening cycle for reactive speed, you will develop the force production and \"springiness\" required for elite performance. A core pillar of this system is \"bulletproofing\" the body; through specialized exercises like ATG squats and Nordic hamstring curls, you will strengthen your knees and ligaments to safely absorb high-impact forces and prevent injury. Ultimately, this program is a \"marathon\" built on maximal intent, challenging you to perform every repetition with the intensity needed to reach your full athletic potential.","level":["Beginner","Novice","Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Athletics","Strength"],"equipment":["Dumbbell Only"],"minutes":30,"joins":26,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-26T18:08:34.651Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Rest Before this Day","Rest Before this Day","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}]},{"n":"Hip Thrust (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}]},{"n":"Depth Jumps","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}]},{"n":"ATG Squats","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}]},{"n":"Sissy Squat","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}]},{"n":"Nordic Curl","sets":[{"r":5,"x":6}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Jump Squat Weighted","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}]},{"n":"Kneeling Jumps To Vertical","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}]},{"n":"Maximum Approach Jumps","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}]},{"n":"Sprin